            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Session rows now include a subtle terminal shortcut. Live sessions locate their existing terminal; saved sessions use the existing resume flow. Clicking the rest of the row opens details. Progress appears on the session being opened, and repeated navigation is disabled until it finishes. Archived, simulated, and bulk-selection rows do not show the shortcut.
]]></description>
